    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "What time",
     "texto": [
      "To say at what time you do something, **um** is used: **um acht Uhr** (at eight o'clock).",
      "**Wann?** = when? **Zu spät** = too late: **Ich bin zu spät** (I'm late). **Jetzt** = now. **Fertig** = ready, finished."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
